summary:
  The stop on the Playing tab is drawn but calls nothing.

history:
  stopWithFade is the one road that ends the standing order, the ladder's
  timer and the network resume together. A stop wired to anything else, or to
  nothing, looks like an off switch and leaves the widget holding the session.

target:
  package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml

find:
                          tooltipText: i18n("Stop")
                          onClicked: stopWithFade()

replace:
                          tooltipText: i18n("Stop")
                          onClicked: { }

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_player_offers_a_stop_a_listener_can_reach.
  Line-neutral.
